{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-isic-2432"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Casting of non-ferrous metals"
 :itonami.blueprint/isic-rev5 "2432"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :non-ferrous-metal-casting/manufacturing
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/social-impact [:worker-safety :materials-safety
                                    :resource-efficiency :environmental-health]
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :nonferrous-foundry-plant-operations-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics true
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:robotics :identity :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger :cae]
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "NonFerrousFoundryAdvisor ⊣ Non-Ferrous Foundry Plant Operations
 Governor, langgraph-clj StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A plant
 OPERATIONS COORDINATION actor for non-ferrous metal (aluminum/copper/
 zinc/brass/bronze/magnesium) CASTING foundries (melting furnace ->
 mold-pouring or die-casting -> cooling/shakeout production line) --
 not direct furnace/pouring-line-equipment control authority. Four ops
 (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Ten concrete governor checks elaborate this
 blueprint's four HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op
 allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct furnace/
 pouring-line-equipment control), permanent furnace-actuate block,
 independent equipment verification/registration before maintenance
 scheduling, independent batch verification/registration before
 shipment coordination, independent shipment-weight recompute against
 the batch's own logged weight, double-schedule guard, alloy-grade
 validation, and defect-rate plausibility validation. Safety-concern
 flagging (molten-metal-hazard/furnace-safety/fume-exposure) ALWAYS
 escalates to a human plant supervisor; `:log-production-batch` is the
 only op eligible to auto-commit, and only at phase 3 when governor-
 clean."}
